*/*_files
*/*.html
**/.DS_Store
.venv

# source decks and videos stay local
*.pptx
*.mp4
*.mov

# FDS run output. Worth keeping: the .out log and the CSVs the eval scripts
# read (_devc.csv, _line.csv). Everything else a run writes is scratch --
# Smokeview geometry and slice/boundary data, plus the run statistics. Each
# case ignores its own results/ already; this is the net for runs made by hand
# in a case directory.
*.smv
*.sf
*.bf
*.bnd
*.q
*.iso
*.s3d
*.prt5
*.end
*.restart
*.stop
*_cpu.csv
*_hrr.csv
*_steps.csv
*_git.txt

# Python bytecode from importing the case eval.py scripts as modules
__pycache__/
*.pyc
